Z||000000||Tabs||08-06-2001||08:03 PM||||Does anybody know were I can get air scoops 4 my fiero in the GTA??? Kinda like the ones on the Indy Fiero  <P>Thankz!!<P>Tabs <P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||08-06-2001||08:36 PM||||Do you mean the over-the-roof type like this?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/All_pics_1.jpg"> <P>You can get them thru IRM.<BR>Email them at IRMFIERO@aol.com<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Tabs||08-06-2001||08:50 PM||||ya but not in the center butover 2 the side where the grills are.  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Do you mean the over-the-roof type like this?<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/All_pics_1.jpg">  <P>You can get them thru IRM.<BR>Email them at IRMFIERO@aol.com<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Oreif||08-06-2001||08:54 PM||||The ones that go over the grates are called:<BR>"Fi-Air-O" scoops. I think FOCOA still sells a version and someplace in Canada. If you don't use the ones with fans in them, they may cause the engine compartment to run hotter. The natural ventilation is to draw air up and out.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fiero_24||08-07-2001||12:02 AM||||Don't do the over the roof scoops.  I was going to until i heard from a few people that had them.  You do not cool the car properly with them.  Heat rises, and if you have air coming down you never let the heat out.  The heat will make its way out, but you are not adding cooling, just looks.  They look great, but I would never add them.  This is just an opinion.  If any one else here has any facts on this I would love to hear them.<P>Craig<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||1
Z||000005||sqoach||08-07-2001||12:35 AM||||If you had an 84 decklid, they'd probably be ok. That is, if your fiero is a notchback.<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||1
