Z||000011||DaRkLoRD||08-07-2001||05:30 PM||||must have been one heck of a genius who designed those... fieros have enough problems with heat as it is.<P>if you do seriously want those, even understanding how much hotter your engine will run (with NO ventilation.....) then check out the sources mentioned above.. but I seriously recommend adding in extra cooling.. decklid vent, etc.<P>but it'll still run hotter.<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||12
